Module 2 – JOIN

A JOIN is used to combine data from two or more tables based on a common column. It helps retrieve related information stored in different tables.

Your experience answer:

In my projects, I have used JOINs to retrieve customer information along with loan details, validate data between multiple tables, and generate reports.
Employee Table
