5. Can We Use Aggregate Functions in WHERE?
Interview Question ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Interviewer: Can we use COUNT(), SUM(), AVG() in WHERE?

Best Answer

No. Aggregate functions cannot be used in the WHERE clause because WHERE executes before GROUP BY. Aggregate values are calculated only after grouping, so we must use HAVING instead.


Wrong Query
